@startuml 07-idempotent-write-and-sensitive-reauth-sequence
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFDF9
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC, Inter, sans-serif"
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam SequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #5C534E

title Idempotent Command Ledger, Sensitive Action Reauth, Unknown Result Reconciliation & Local Draft Recovery

actor "User" as User
participant "Client UI\n(FeaturePages / SensitiveSheets)" as Ui
participant "SensitiveActionStore\n(kmp/shared)" as SensitiveStore
participant "Encrypted CommandVault\n(Android EncryptedPrefs / iOS Keychain /\nDesktop java-keyring AES-GCM /\nWeb IndexedDB AES-GCM)" as Vault
participant "Go API\n(mobileapi.Handler +\npostgres.MobileRepository)" as Api
database "PostgreSQL\n(mobile_command_ledger +\npurpose_reauth_grants +\ndomain tables)" as Db

== 1. Sensitive Write Preparation & Purpose Reauth Grant (10-Minute Single-Use) ==
User -> Ui : Trigger high-risk action\n(e.g. Apply Adoption / Propose Return / Unlink Identity / Data Erasure / Account Closure)
Ui -> SensitiveStore : ensureGrantAndExecute(purpose, commandType, payloadJson)
SensitiveStore -> Vault : Check cached active grant for `purpose` & generate deterministic `requestId` (UUIDv4)\nPersist PendingCommand(requestId, commandType, payloadHash, status=PENDING)

alt No valid cached Reauth Grant for `purpose`
  SensitiveStore --> Ui : Show Reauth Modal (Password or SMS OTP)
  User -> Ui : Submit credential
  Ui -> SensitiveStore : submitPasswordReauth(purpose, password) / submitSmsReauth(purpose, code)
  SensitiveStore -> Api : POST /api/v2/auth/reauth {purpose, method, credential}
  Api -> Db : Verify credential & INSERT purpose_reauth_grants\n(token_hash=SHA256(token), expires_at=now+10m, consumed_at=NULL)
  Api --> SensitiveStore : 200 {reauthToken, purpose, expiresAt}
  SensitiveStore -> Vault : Store single-use reauthToken for `purpose`
end

== 2. Idempotent Command Execution under PostgreSQL SERIALIZABLE Transaction ==
SensitiveStore -> Api : POST /api/v2/<domain-mutation>\nHeaders:\n  Authorization: Bearer <token>\n  X-Client-Request-Id: <requestId>\n  X-Reauth-Token: <reauthToken>\nBody: <payloadJson>

Api -> Db : BEGIN ISOLATION LEVEL SERIALIZABLE
Api -> Db : SELECT * FROM mobile_command_ledger\nWHERE user_id = $1 AND request_id = $2 FOR UPDATE

alt New RequestId (First Execution)
  Api -> Db : INSERT mobile_command_ledger (status='in_progress', payload_hash=SHA256(body))
  Api -> Db : UPDATE purpose_reauth_grants SET consumed_at = NOW()\nWHERE user_id = $1 AND purpose = $2 AND token_hash = SHA256(reauthToken) AND consumed_at IS NULL AND expires_at > NOW()
  Api -> Db : Execute domain state transition & INSERT mobile_outbox_events
  Api -> Db : UPDATE mobile_command_ledger\nSET status='completed', response_status=200, response_json=<result>\nCOMMIT
else Network Timeout / Connection Drop Before Response Reaches Client
  Api --x SensitiveStore : Socket Timeout / EOF (OperationResultUnknown)
  SensitiveStore -> Vault : Mark command status = UNKNOWN_RESULT\nPreserve local draft & photo queue items (Never auto-blind-retry non-idempotent side effects)
  SensitiveStore --> Ui : Emit Effect -> Navigate / Banner to UnknownCommandRecovery Page
end

== 3. Deterministic Unknown Command Reconciliation & Exact Replay ==
User -> Ui : Open UnknownCommandRecovery Page & tap "Reconcile / Retry"
Ui -> SensitiveStore : reconcileUnknownCommand(requestId)
SensitiveStore -> Api : GET /api/v2/commands/{requestId} (or Replay POST with same X-Client-Request-Id & identical payload)
Api -> Db : Lookup mobile_command_ledger(user_id, request_id)

alt Payload Hash Matches Completed Ledger Entry
  Db --> Api : Found completed entry (response_status, response_json)
  Api --> SensitiveStore : Replay exact stored HTTP status & JSON body (without re-running business mutation or requiring new reauth)
  SensitiveStore -> Vault : Remove PendingCommand & clear associated LocalPhotoBatchDraft
  SensitiveStore --> Ui : Restore confirmed state & notify user
else Same RequestId Reused with Different Payload Hash
  Db --> Api : payload_hash mismatch!
  Api --> SensitiveStore : 409 Conflict {code: "idempotency_payload_mismatch"}
end

@enduml
